SUMMARY:Earthshot Innovation Challenge Pitch Competition 
LOCATION:The Pub
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Quin Impact Fund\nPrice: Free\nStatus: You are Con
 firmed\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/199492\n\n5:00P
 M Reception\, 5:30PM Program\nBefore the spotlight turns to the annual Ear
 thshot Innovation Challenge Award Ceremony at the John F. Kennedy Presiden
 tial Library this winter\, The 'Quin Impact Fund invites members to an exc
 lusive first look at the next generation of climate innovation.\n\nDuring 
 this special preview\, Earthshot Innovation Challenge semi-finalists will 
 present their breakthrough concepts\, sharing bold ideas designed to addre
 ss some of the world's most pressing environmental challenges. Members wil
 l hear each pitch\, engage with the ideas\, and cast their votes in real t
 ime to select the solution they wish to propel into the challenge finals\,
  securing at least $25\,000 in grant funding\, and raising their chances t
 o be awarded the top prize of $100\,000.\n\nThis exclusive event offers a 
 unique opportunity to experience the innovation process firsthand while he
 lping elevate promising solutions before they take the stage at the formal
  competition. Be among the first to discover the visionary entrepreneurs s
 haping a more sustainable future - and play a role in recognizing the idea
 s with the greatest potential to create lasting impact.\n\n*This event is 
 complimentary and reserved for members only. Complimentary light bites an
 d refreshments will be served. We kindly ask that all cancellations be ma
 de at least 24 hours prior to the start of the event.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/199492
CATEGORIES:‘Quin Impact Fund
END:VEVENT
